# REQUIREMENTS: cu-003

CU-003 implements enrichment via CLI calls to opencode, replacing LitellmClient.is_relevant/embed_text HTTP calls: one `opencode run --format json --model <model>` subprocess per article, prompt loaded from classpath resource prompts/enrich.txt, concatenated `part.text` payloads from the NDJSON event stream parsed as the enrichment JSON (first-{ to last-}). Requires cu-001 (RssItem, Enrichment, EnrichmentPort). This CU satisfies feat-1 criteria 3 (per-item CLI + JSON parse) and 4 (no LLM HTTP on the Scala path).
